  "remarks": "LLC GRUPPA PROMAVTO specialises in the manufacture of vehicle and semi-trailers. It is one of the sub-contractors of JSC IEMZ Kupol. Specifically, it supplies specialised escort vehicles of the Garpiya one-way attack UAV. These UAVs are used by the Russian Armed Forces during Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine.",
